  ('living-well-with-roommates', 1, 'Say a cheerful hello to whoever is home when you walk in, and ask how their day was.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 2, 'Rinse your own mug and set it back on the shelf with a small smile for whoever shares the kitchen with you.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 3, 'Hold the front door for a housemate coming in with their arms full.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 4, 'Put one thing you love, like a photo or a plant, where you can see it from your bed.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 5, 'Write down the three shared bills you think about most, so they are out of your head and on paper.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 6, 'Ask a housemate, while the kettle boils, how their week is going so far, and simply listen to the answer.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 7, 'Wipe the sink after you finish the dishes tonight, so the next person finds it clean and dry.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 8, 'Ask a roommate how their day went, and listen to the answer without checking your phone.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 9, 'Clear one small surface in your room so your eyes have a calm place to rest.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 10, 'Pick a simple place, like a shared phone note or a sheet on the fridge, where everyone can write down who paid for what.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 11, 'Pick one small annoyance that has bugged you lately and write it down in a single sentence, just for yourself.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 12, 'Ask your roommates which fridge shelf they would like to call their own, and offer them first pick.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 13, 'Bring in a package left on the step for a housemate and set it somewhere they will see it.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 14, 'Ask your roommates what quiet hours would suit everyone, and suggest a time that works for you too.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 15, 'Add one recent shared purchase to your who paid what note, with the date and the amount, so nothing lives only in your head.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 16, 'Turn that sentence into an "I" statement, such as "I feel rushed when the bathroom is busy at seven," and read it aloud once.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 17, 'Label your leftovers with your name and the date on a strip of tape, so nobody has to guess.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 18, 'Leave the porch light on tonight for a roommate who is coming home after dark.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 19, 'Wear headphones for music or videos in shared rooms this evening, so others can enjoy their own sounds.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 20, 'Find out over tea one evening whether the way you split the electric bill still feels fair to everyone in the home.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 21, 'Notice when your roommates seem relaxed this evening, and save any tricky topic for a calm moment like that.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 22, 'Clear out anything of yours in the fridge that is past its best before you shop again.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 23, 'Suggest a simple potluck where everyone brings one dish they already know how to make.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 24, 'Bring up overnight guests over a relaxed chat, and ask how much notice everyone would like.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 25, 'Draft a short, friendly message reminding a roommate about money they owe, read it once aloud, then soften any word that sounds sharp.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 26, 'Suggest a short, relaxed house meeting this weekend, with a pot of tea on the table and a promise to finish within half an hour.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 27, 'Suggest a loose morning bathroom order if mornings feel rushed, asking everyone what time works for them.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 28, 'Pull a board game from the closet and let everyone know they''re welcome to play after dinner.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 29, 'Before borrowing anything today, even a charger, send a quick message to check it is okay.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 30, 'Open a money reminder with something kind, such as "No rush, just a heads up," before you mention the amount.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 31, 'Offer to keep the house meeting to three topics at most, and let everyone add one to a shared list beforehand.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 32, 'Keep your shower short on a busy weekday morning so the next person still has hot water.'),
  ('living-well-with-roommates', 33, 'Add each roommate''s birthday to your calendar so the date never sneaks past you.'),
